.RE
.PP
This functions adds \fRaddrinfo\fP to the given DNS cache \fRcache\fP\&.

.PP
If an entry for [host,port] already exists, \fRaddrinfo\fP is free'd and replaced by the cached entry\&. Do not free \fRaddrinfo\fP yourself - this will be done when the whole cache is freed\&. 
